|term[entity] :status settled :defined-by def-entities-values-promises :anchor entity-value-object
  :word entity
  :alternates [entities]
  A thing whose identity is independent of its current description — it persists through change.
  |invariants
    - Is the dual of [[term/value-object]]
    - Never a [[term/value-object]]
    - Identified by one or more [[term/designator]] — nothing in its content can testify to its identity
    - Any content-derived handle silently becomes a handle to a snapshot the moment the entity changes
